  "decisions": [
    "Accept fifteen compact vessel responses in each PRQ acquisition; VV/VH and historical details support presence and the visual boxes exclude sidelobes.",
    "One PRQ Jan18 vessel has the same physical key in canal/fondeo; do not inflate independent support.",
    "PRQ Jan2 weak additional proposal remains unknown and entirely outside reviewed scope. Other weak signatures and unresolved quay interfaces are excluded, not negative labels.",
    "Caribe Jan1 has only three partial observations; uncovered zones are not empty.",
    "STC fondeo Jan21 is mostly land. Only the explicitly inspected small water area supplies negative scope; this is not representative anchorage coverage.",
    "STC muelles Jan21 scope is null after removing an unusable subpixel-width residual; remaining eighteen scopes have reviewed pixel centers and usable interior.",
    "No family or physical dimensions are inferred from radar response boxes."
  ]
